libaec
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This crate is checked against libaec 1.1.7, and its conformance corpus
(tests/fixtures/) is built from input patterns ported from libaec's
tests/check_code_options.c by tools/build_aec_fixtures.py in the Fieldglass
repository. The streams in the corpus were written by libaec's encoder, and the
expected outputs recorded in tests/fixtures/manifest.json were produced by
